623335", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dpt71OJlKAEQ7kNvwHUwIh3&_nc_oc=AdoQ9wBsPV4xMa2nBb6DjzMhgcErl2YaDuYbmt1kZOXizDLbendjzHAieATArZwbMWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD4EpPxfNslS1p0LiZ5Rzu14OBzZX2zq_wPF_jTcF9O3A&oe=6A5638E2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cGScwHU9dGwQ7kNvwGXycq5&_nc_oc=Adr5NuuYCfH26Zm1skcd4ihMU3z6V8EV9_6MvHawz-Qqaj9lMoMY_JVOqgDhksydFbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSVpfTkW9ZUIZWiB0icy6xgDU8XAk98M6xYoUGDaRnqQ&oe=6A564673"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lckd0tg67XkQ7kNvwGQ_jJZ&_nc_oc=AdqWhXnPGqUGOu-dMeYK7s2FFbt9yuiT3WONx61Fcl4Lq7Gw3zDCuKIxQNjtNs5FhcM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAVQUaiza8-wLCmHDCQJ27M7CmbBKYjByGjF2zuHeYkEQ&oe=6A563AEB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t0TFuC08puIQ7kNvwHTFZZI&_nc_oc=AdrhquXitXKI_1h6zVG5UypRJ6cIQh25eoivH61bn_m9Eu0hzy9t6StW3DNWYD3ISII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA0bWQ8L7vbf7JT8-pwRQ5PfwntuRAWYCFLpD_Uv4ObxQ&oe=6A565822"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RhfZQ4jprYAQ7kNvwHMPGGk&_nc_oc=Ado6ey3EJtAvdhI6F42AThjZq6s3wj10NVDBHf20fmmqq_kmzSe9AoGG62v7kM9FZ7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCpGfPvax1NrFqwF4S_K2pczBx9fLpTL7SNAoPmzdopGQ&oe=6A565ABD"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292